ith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Concerning%20Man%27s%20Perfection%20in%20Righteousness.html"},{"n":16,"t":"(14.)the Fourteenth Breviate.","c":0,"path":["Concerning Man's Perfection in Righteousness"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Concerning%20Man%27s%20Perfection%20in%20Righteousness.html"},{"n":17,"t":"(15.) the Fifteenth Breviate.","c":0,"path":["Concerning Man's Perfection in Righteousness"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Concerning%20Man%27s%20Perfection%20in%20Righteousness.html"},{"n":18,"t":"Chapter VII. (16.) the Sixteenth Breviate.","c":0,"path":["Concerning Man's Perfection in Righteousness"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Concerning%20Man%27s%20Perfection%20in%20Righteousness.html"},{"n":19,"t":"Chapter VIII. (17.) It is One Thing to Depart from the Body, Another Thing to Be Liberated from the Body of This Death.","c":0,"path":["Concerning Man's Perfection in Righteousness"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Concerning%20Man%27s%20Perfection%20in%20Righteousness.html"},{"n":20,"t":"(18.) the Righteousness of This Life Comprehended in Three Parts,-Fasting, Alms-Giving, and Prayer.","c":0,"path":["Concerning Man's Perfection in Righteousness"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Concerning%20Man%27s%20Perfection%20in%20Righteousness.html"},{"n":21,"t":"(19.) the Commandment of Love Shall Be Perfectly Fulfilled in the Life to Come.","c":0,"path":["Concerning Man's Perfection in Righteousness"],"url":"https://github.com/HistoricalChristianFaith/Writings-Database/tree/master/Augustine%20of%20Hippo/Concerning%20Man%27s%20Perfection%20in%20Righteousness.html"},{"n":22,"t":"Chapter IX. (